.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Epic Boss Battles</strong>: Challenge and defeat powerful bosses in their strongholds to claim new territories and rewards. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot and Progression</strong>: Pillage enemy provinces for unique loot to bolster your squad and customize your champions' abilities and stats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359730/extras/5e29d5d2d98911422a6d173a801ba222.poster.avif?t=1766641125\" width=616 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359730/extras/5e29d5d2d98911422a6d173a801ba222.webm?t=1766641125\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359730/extras/5e29d5d2d98911422a6d173a801ba222.mp4?t=1766641125\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","developers":["Silvine Game Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1359730/header.jpg?t=1766641125","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 Silvine Game Studios Pvt Ltd. All rights reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1359730/726734/bb5258c3245024ace53cf75406ced9924f051070/1751226836/dash_av1.mpd?t=1721140392","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1359730/726734/bb5258c3245024ace53cf75406ced9924f05